  "unit": "u11-plans",
  "title": "I'll do it",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**The future for আমি and আমরা ends in -ব** (*-bo*). Take the আমি present form, drop the final **-ই** and add **-ব**:\n\n- করি → **করব** 'I'll do'\n- পড়ি → **পড়ব** 'I'll read'\n- খাই → **খাব**, ঘুমাই → **ঘুমাব**\n\n**আমরা** uses exactly the same form: **আমরা টিভি দেখব** 'We'll watch TV'.\n\nYou'll often see a final **ো**: করবো, খাবো. Both spellings are fine when you type.\n\n**থাকব** is 'I'll stay' or 'I'll be (somewhere)': **আমি ঢাকায় থাকব** 'I'll be in Dhaka'.",
  "vocab": [
